   {id:2030,speaker:"Engineer",en:"I understand. Topology means the connection structure.",cn:"我明白了，拓扑就是连接结构。",ipa:"/…/",tags:["第30句","仪表盘与数据厅","★★★★"],when:"工程师汇报执行结果或提出操作问题。",words:[{w:"topology",ipa:"/təˈpɒlədʒi/",pos:"名词",cn:"拓扑图；连接结构",memory:"topo(地方)+logy(学科)→研究各部分如何连接→拓扑",phonics:"to 读 /tə/，pol 读 /pɒl/，o 读 /ə/，gy 读 /dʒi/",collocations:[["power topology","电力拓扑图"],["network topology","网络拓扑图"],["topology diagram","拓扑图"]],examples:[["Check the power topology.","检查电力拓扑图。"],["The topology shows the links.","拓扑图显示连接链路。"]]},{w:"log",ipa:"/lɒɡ/",pos:"名词/动词",cn:"日志；记录",memory:"log = 原木→航海日志→泛指记录。",phonics:"log 读 /lɒɡ/",collocations:[["shift log","交班日志"],["log in","登录"],["system log","系统日志"]],examples:[["Log in to the system.","登录系统。"],["Record this in the shift log.","记录到交班日志里。"]]}],phrases:[{p:"I understand. Topology means the connection structure",ipa:"",cn:"I understand. Topology 的意思是 the connection structure",why:"means 用来解释术语含义，是数据中心交接中最常用的释义句型。"},{p:"understand. Topology means",ipa:"",cn:"仪表盘与数据厅相关表达",why:"\"understand. Topology means\" 是本句的核心表达，在数据中心仪表盘与数据厅场景中高频使用。"}],grammar:[{q:"X means Y 句型怎么用？",a:"means = 意思是/指的是，用于解释术语和缩写。\n✅ PTW means Permit To Work.（PTW是作业许可证。）\n✅ Bypass means the load is fed from mains.（旁路指负载由市电供电。）\n注意 mean 要加 s（第三人称单数）：X means Y。"}],pattern:"I + 动作 + 对象 + 结果/状态",patternExamples:[{en:"UPS means Uninterruptible Power Supply.",cn:"UPS是不间断电源。",words:[]},{en:"CRAC means Computer Room Air Conditioning.",cn:"CRAC是精密空调。",words:[]},{en:"ATS means Automatic Transfer Switch.",cn:"ATS是自动切换开关。",words:[]}],thinking:"英语汇报句型：I + 动作 + 结果。\n中文说「我已经做了XX」，英语同样：I have done X / I will do X。\n注意 I have + 过去分词 = 已经做完（现在完成时），I will + 动词原形 = 将要做。",pronunciation:"保持语速平稳，关键词适当加重。",quiz:[{q:"把「我明白了，拓扑就是连接结构。」用英语说出来。",a:"I understand. Topology means the connection structure."},{q:"「拓扑图；连接结构」用英语怎么说？",a:"topology (/təˈpɒlədʒi/)"}]},
